``` Cross-account login-timing correlation: many unrelated accounts
    authenticating within a tight synchronized window - the credential-
    farm "heartbeat". Fixed-bucket approximation of
    detection/timing_correlation.py::detect_bursts()'s sliding-window
    two-pointer scan; the Python version is more precise (a burst
    spanning a bucket boundary here could get split across two rows),
    but bucketing is the SPL-idiomatic way to build this correlation
    directly in Splunk. Saved in the live instance as
    "Login Integrity - Cross-Account Credential Farm Burst". ```
index=login_integrity_auth
| bucket _time span=3s
| stats dc(user_id) as distinct_users values(user_id) as users by _time
| where distinct_users>=4
| sort -distinct_users
